      "severity": "high",
      "description": "The function returns True when now equals expires_at, but the contract requires that a token be inactive at or after expires_at. The current implementation returns True for the boundary case, incorrectly marking the token as active.",
      "evidence": "Calling active(10, 10) returns True, but per the specification it should return False because the token is inactive at expiration."
    }
  ]
